Modifications (this repository is a Derivative Work of fishaudio/drama-3-int4):
- The routed experts of every MoE layer of the text backbone were pruned from 256 to 160.
  The 160 kept per layer are the ones the original model's router chose most often while
  generating about 150 Korean and English lines (router statistics, no retraining).
  config.json text_config.num_experts = 160; the router weights were cut to match.
- Nothing else in the weights was changed (the experts stay int4 as in fishaudio/drama-3-int4).
- sglang-omni-patch/drama3-hadamard8.patch is an optional runtime patch for SGLang-Omni that
  stores lm_head, embed_tokens and the audio decoder's linear layers as Hadamard-rotated int8
  (W8A8) when the model loads. The files on disk are not changed by it.
  Its int8 kernels are adapted from FreeVideo (freevideo_engine/int8_ops.py, Copyright FlashML-org,
  Apache License 2.0). SGLang-Omni is Apache License 2.0.

